"<strong>Warning: </strong> \n"
"                        Changing this baseline alters annual labor leave and average wage calculations for all future payslips until 12 months of payslips accumulate.\n"
"                        Once payslips are validated using this value, it cannot be changed retroactively."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ogohlantirish: </strong> \n"
"                        Ushbu boshlang'ich ko'rsatkichni o'zgartirish 12 oylik hisob varaqalari to'planguncha barcha kelgusi hisob varaqalari uchun yillik mehnat ta'tili va o'rtacha ish haqi hisob-kitoblariga ta'sir qiladi.\n"
"                        Ushbu qiymat asosida hisob varaqalari tasdiqlangach, uni orqaga qaytarib o'zgartirib bo'lmaydi."

